; Project Kaos-Byte2.0v (The Static Rift), Dashlaunch build for RGH / JTAG / BadUpdate + XeUnshackle.
; Add one of the lines below to Dashlaunch's launch.ini, in the [Plugins] section, using the first
; free pluginN number (plugin1 ... plugin5).
;
; BadUpdate + XeUnshackle: the launch.ini in the root of the USB stick you run BadUpdate from (one
; on the hard drive isn't read). Put the Plugins folder on the stick too and use the Usb: line.
; RGH / JTAG: the launch.ini Dashlaunch uses (root of Hdd1, or of a USB stick); the Hdd: line.
[Plugins]
plugin1 = Usb:\Plugins\Kaos-Byte2.0v-RGH.xex
; or, with the Plugins folder on Hdd1:
; plugin1 = Hdd:\Plugins\Kaos-Byte2.0v-RGH.xex
